{"overview":"جیمز ریس، فرمانده یگان ویژه نیروی دریایی، در حالی که درباره نیروهای مرموز پشت صحنه قتل تمام افراد جوخه اش تحقیق می کند، به مسیر انتقام قدم می گذارد. ریس که از ساختار فرماندهی ارتش آزاد شده، درس هایی را که از نزدیک به دو دهه جنگ آموخته، به کار می بندد تا افراد مسئول را شکار کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Navy SEAL Commander James Reece turns to vengeance as he investigates the mysterious forces behind the murder of his entire platoon. Free from the military's command structure, Reece applies the lessons he's learned from nearly two decades of warfare to hunt down the people responsible.","tagline_en":"The mission isn't over.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2022,"poster":"/ujVz6YZxBkDsw3wanO2AKhl3A9y.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/xyFAzP7RKK8cARCSalIZ9A9T0jV.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["David DiGilio"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کریس پرت","role":"James Reece","photo":"/cRH6HPAQ98PlOwwEvhYO4CM9lwu.jpg","en":"Chris Pratt"},{"name":"Constance Wu","role":"Katie Buranek","photo":"/7nT6QsetU2RCUwopPmq2NFSnLDL.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Hopper","role":"Raife Hastings","photo":"/4Bx09xFBXIWIhptQ10yJEPbB1HI.jpg"},{"name":"Dar Salim","role":"Mo Farooq","photo":"/mqIH4exzdXXU47ykPohDTAkZ8tN.jpg"},{"name":"اولگا کوریلنکو","role":"Yana Tomenko","photo":"/ei6eYUhQFw2AaV6U5fyPptBaPF0.jpg","en":"Olga Kurylenko"},{"name":"Yul Vazquez","role":"Vic Rodriguez","photo":"/chAxqgeJVoRoQukw7zRYgtlo4KI.jpg"},{"name":"Costa Ronin","role":"Vasili Andrenov","photo":"/6PjUNZ6HYCT5PlQdXFI1ue2tOls.jpg"},{"name":"جرمی باب","role":"Oliver Grey","photo":"/4f4nYrCuwEbgEPFOK78SdSwoKuT.jpg","en":"Jeremy Bobb"},{"name":"گابریل لونا","role":"Freddy Strain","photo":"/bIPORtYxTJPEUJIThbZrpqf4A11.jpg","en":"Gabriel Luna"}],"trailer":"x9FvvsC0B5Q","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/120911-the-terminal-list/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZ